    <div class="polsec"><h2>Deposits</h2>
      <p class="editable">A <b>{{ site.policies.deposit_pct }} deposit</b> is required to book and holds your spot. Your deposit is applied to your service total at checkout, so it's never an extra cost.</p></div>
    <div class="polsec"><h2>Cancellations &amp; Rescheduling</h2>
      <p class="editable">Life happens! Please give at least <b>{{ site.policies.cancellation_notice }}' notice</b> to cancel or reschedule so someone else can take your time.</p>
      <ul class="editable">
        <li>Less than 24 hours' notice: <b>{{ site.policies.fee_short_notice }}</b> of the service price</li>
        <li>Same-day cancellation: <b>{{ site.policies.fee_same_day }}</b> of the service price</li>
        <li>No-call, no-show: <b>{{ site.policies.fee_no_show }}</b> of the service price</li>
      </ul></div>
    <!-- ===== DRAFT: Refunds section - PENDING JILLIAN APPROVAL. Do NOT publish until approved. To go live: remove this comment wrapper (the opening line above and the END line below). Approval doc: "12 - Reports & Handoffs/Rosemary-Refund-Cancellation-Policy-DRAFT.md"
    <div class="polsec"><h2>Refunds</h2>
      <p class="editable">Your <b>{{ site.policies.deposit_pct }} deposit</b> is non-refundable, but it is never wasted as long as you give at least 24 hours' notice: it moves with you to your rescheduled appointment and still goes toward your service. If you cancel with less than 24 hours' notice, cancel same-day, or do not show, the deposit is kept and the cancellation fee above applies.</p>
      <p class="editable">Because every service is personalized and performed in the moment, completed services are not refundable. Your happiness still matters to us: if something does not feel right, reach out within 7 days and we will make it right, whether that is an adjustment or a plan for your next visit.</p></div>
    ===== END DRAFT Refunds ===== -->
    <div class="polsec"><h2>Late Arrivals</h2>
      <p class="editable">Arriving 10&ndash;15 minutes late may mean your service is shortened or needs to be rescheduled, so every client gets their full appointment time.</p></div>
    <div class="polsec"><h2>Minors</h2>
      <p class="editable">Clients under 18 are welcome with parent or guardian consent. Teen facials are one of our favorite ways to build healthy skin habits early.</p></div>
    <div class="polsec"><h2>Health &amp; Safety</h2>
      <p class="editable">For your safety, we can't perform services over <b>active wounds, sunburned skin, contagious skin conditions, cold sores, or irritated skin</b>. If you're not sure whether something applies to you, reach out before booking and we'll figure it out together.</p></div>
